@@ -0,0 +1,31 @@
+# Local 1.2.1 Cheats Implementation Plan
+
+> For agentic workers: use superpowers:executing-plans task by task.
+
+Goal: implement the five approved local single-player cheat probes, independently switchable, and distinguish tests from field verification.
+Architecture: a small memory-access core with injected checked reader/writer, plus a macOS adapter in the loader. Only 1.2.1 and its verified rewritten main digest are accepted. Configuration is opt-in and refreshed by a low-frequency thread; testing uses a separate profile.
+Tech stack: C11, Mach self-task read/write, Python unittest/C fixture.
+Spec: /Volumes/SwitchNative/Tools/王国之泪1.2.1金手指方案.md
+
+## Global Constraints
+No global cheat VM or arbitrary code loading. No main checkout edits. No original saves or existing apps overwritten. Only five features: current-max health, stamina, current weapon durability; 999998 rupees; collected material count 888. Config initially disabled, read-only inspection available. Invalid mappings, values and pointer chains cause skips. Exclude executable memory writes.
+
+## Review Focus
+Null/freed objects: checked reads and writes; empty inventory sentinels: retain; wrong version: deny; absent/malformed config: disable all; scene changes: no writes through unchecked raw pointers. Runtime object races remain a known limitation: live test on copied saves only.
+
+### Task 1: Core
+Files: games/totk/runtime/local_cheats121.h; tests/local_cheats121_probe.c; tests/test_local_cheats121.py.
+- [ ] Write fixture for health/stamina/weapon/money/materials plus disabled/null/unreadable cases; run red against no-op API.
+- [ ] Implement narrowly translated pointer rules, including material conditional pointer advancement from the supplied codes.
+- [ ] Run green and sanitizer checks; record result.
+
+### Task 2: Adapter
+Files: games/totk/runtime/local_cheats121_host.h; runtime/loader.c.
+- [ ] Validate configuration parser and version guard with negative cases.
+- [ ] Add guarded self-memory access (readable/writable non-executable ranges), config refresh, counters; wire only v121 boot path.
+- [ ] Build changed runtime in a separate APFS-cloned work folder after normal 1.2.1 completes; package separate bundle using same validated data.
+
+### Task 3: Runtime
+- [ ] Copy profile to T7 experimental profile. Enable each feature independently then together; log addresses only when necessary, no unrelated data.
+- [ ] Observe actual gameplay; do not assert features untestable in prologue are working.
+- [ ] Verify disable and restart; run full unittest suite, fresh review, record status and remaining limitations.
